---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How SoloStack makes money and how that affects what we publish."
>
  <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
  <p>
    SoloStack.io is reader-supported. When you click certain links on this site and sign up for a paid
    plan, we may earn a commission from the company whose product you purchased. This is called
    affiliate marketing, and it is how we keep this site free and ad-light.
  </p>
  <h2>What this means for you</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Using an affiliate link never costs you more than going to the company directly — commissions are paid out of the company's marketing budget, not added to your bill.</li>
    <li>We do not accept payment in exchange for a positive review. If we don't like a tool, we say so, whether or not it has an affiliate program.</li>
    <li>Not every tool we mention has an affiliate relationship with us. Where one exists, it does not change our ranking criteria.</li>
    <li>Articles are marked with an affiliate disclosure notice at the top.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>If you want to know whether a specific link is an affiliate link, email <a href="mailto:hello@solostack.io">hello@solostack.io</a> and we'll tell you.</p>
</BaseLayout>
